    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.4.27.1.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "(12) Εἰ δὲ κατὰ φύσιν ἔχει. Ἔστι τάχα τινὰ προστάγματα Κυρίου, ἃ οὐ δεῖ ποιεῖν, κατὰ τό· Ἕδωξαν αὐτοῖς προστάγματα οὐ καλά.",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.4.27.1.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.4.27.1.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ψυχὴ οὖν ἁμαρτάνει ἀκουσίως, ὅτε προφάσει εὐσεβείας τὸ μὴ δέον τηρεῖ.",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.4.27.1.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.4.27.1.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Καὶ δεῖται θυσίας πρὸς ἄφεσιν, οὐ δεομένου θυσίας τοῦ δρῶντος ἐξεπίτηδες· ὡς ὁ γεγονὼς Ἰουδαῖος, ἵνα Ἰουδαίους κερδήσῃ, καὶ περιτεμὼν τὸν Τιμόθεον.",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.4.28.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.4.28.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Στίχ. κη΄. Σημαίνει οὖν, ὅτι ἀμσρτία καλεῖται καὶ αὐτὸ τὸ προσαγόμενον. Οὕτω νοητέον τό· Ἁμαρτίας λαοῦ μου φάγονται.",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.4.28.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.4.28.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Εἰ οὖν ὁ ἁμαρτάνων αὐτὴν δοκεῖ θύειν τὴν ἁμαρτίαν ἐν τῷ μετανοεῖν, οὐκ ὀφείλει τοῖς αὐτοῖς περιπίπτειν, ἐπεὶ ἀναζῇ ἡ ἁμαρτία.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.4.28.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.4.28.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Οὕτω δυνατὸν τὸν Χριστὸν καλεῖν ἀμαρείαν, ὡς ὑπὸρ τῆς πάντων ἁμαρτίας τυθέντα.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.12.2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.12.2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Στίχ. β΄. Γυνὴ ἥτις ἐὰν σπερματισθῇ, καὶ τέκῃ ἄρσεν.",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.12.2.1.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.12.2.1.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Παρέλκειν δόξει τὸ, ἐὰν σπερματισθῇ, προτασσόμενον τοῦ· καὶ τέκῃ ἄρσεν.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.12.2.1.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.12.2.1.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἀλλʼ ἐφίστημι μήποτε ἵνα προφητικῶς ἡ Μαρία, οὐκ ἐκ τοῦ ἐσπερματίσθαι (17) τεκοῦσα ἄρσεν, μὴ νομισθῇ ἀκάθαρτος εἶναι, γεγεννηκυῖα τὸν Σωτῆρα,",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.12.2.1.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.12.2.1.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "εἴρηκεν ὅλον Ἐδύνατο δὲ καὶ μὴ προκειμένου τοῦ, Ἐὰν σπερματισθῇ, νοεῖσθαι μὴ οὖσα ἀκάθαρτος ἡ Μαρία· οὐ γὰρ ἀπλῶς γυνὴ, ἀλλὰ παρθένος.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.13.45",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.13.45",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Στίχ. με΄. Καὶ ὁ λεπρὸς, ἐν ᾧ ἐστιν ἀφὴ, τὰ ἱμάτια αὐτοῦ ἔσται παραλελυμένα, καὶ ἡ κεφαλὴ αὐτοῦ ἀκάλυπτος.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.13.45.1.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.13.45.1.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Διατί τοῦ λεπροῦ ἀκάλυπτον εἶναι κελεύει τὴν κεφαλὴν, καὶ τὰ ἱμάτια παραλελυμένα; Ἵνα γνωριστὸς ᾗ καὶ μὴ μετσλαγχάνωσι τῆς ἀκαθαρσίας οἱ προσπελάζοντες.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.13.45.1.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.13.45.1.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Οὕτως ὁ Ἀπόστολος περὶ τῶν ἁμαρτανόντων ἔφη· Στέλλεσθε ὑμᾶς ἀπὸ παντὸς ἀδελφοῦ ἀτάκτως περιπατοῦντος, καὶ μὴ κατὰ τὴν παράδοσιν, ἣν παρελάβετε παῤ ἡμῶν·",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.13.45.1.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.13.45.1.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "καὶ, Ἐάν τις ἀδελφὸς ὀνομαζόμενος, ἢ πόρνος, ἢ πλεονέκτης, ἢ εἰδωλολάτρης, ἢ μέθυσος, ἢ λοίδορος, ἢ ἅρπαξ· τῷ τοιούτῳ μὴ συνεσθίειν (18).",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.23.2.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.23.2.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Στίχ. β΄. Αὗται αἱ ἑορταὶ Κυρίου. Πᾶσα ἱλαρὰ ἡμέρα, ἐν ᾗ προτέτακται (19), ὡς ἐν ἁγίᾳ τάδε τινὰ ποιεῖν παρὰ τὰς λοιπὰς ἐξαίρετα, ἑορτὴ καλεῖται.",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.23.2.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.23.2.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Οὐ πᾶσα δέ ἐστι πανήγυρις· ἀλλὰ κατὰ τοὔνομα, ὅτε ἐπὶ τὸ αὐτὸ συναθροίζονται πανταχόθεν.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.23.2.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.23.2.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ὥστε ἡ μὲν πανήγυρίς ἐστι καὶ ἑορτή· οὐκέτι δὲ ἑορτὴ, καὶ πανήγυρις· οἷον· Σάββατα καὶ Νουμηνίαι, ἑορταί εἰσιν·",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.23.2.s4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.23.2.s4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἄζυμα δὲ, καὶ ἡμέραι τῶν Ἑβδομάδων, καὶ Σκηνοπηγίαι οὐ μόνον ἑορταὶ, ἀλλὰ καὶ πανηγύρεις.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.23.40.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.23.40.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Στίχ. μ΄. Καὶ κάλλυντρα φοινίκων. Πάρεστι διὰ τούτων νοεῖν (20), καὶ πάλιν ἡμῖν ἐν Χριστῷ τὰς ἐν παραδείσῳ τρυφὰς ἀπονέμει Θεός.",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.23.40.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.23.40.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Φυτῶν δὲ τῶν ἀειθαλῶν οἱ κλάδοι, τὸ διηνεκὲς τῆς χάριτος καὶ τὸ ἀμάραντον τῆς ἐλπίδος ἐφʼ ἑαυτοῖς σημαίνουσι.",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.27.15.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.27.15.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Στίχ. ιε΄. Ἐὰν δὲ ὁ ἁγιάσας αὐτὴν λυτρῶται τὴν οἰκίαν αὐτοῦ, προσθήσει ἐπʼ αὐτὸ τὸ ἐπίπεμπτον τοῦ ἀργυρίου τῆς ταμῆς, καὶ ἔσται αὐτῷ.",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.27.15.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.27.15.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Εἰ δὲ μὴ τιμὴν οἰκίας, ἢ ἀγροῦ τις, ἀλλʼ αὐτὰ ἁγιάσαι Θεῷ, τὴν τιμὴν καθήσει μετὰ τοῦ πέμπτου λυτρούμενος αὐτὰ, καὶ|καθέξει τὰς κτήσεις· ἑτέροις δὲ οὐκ ἀποδώσεται.",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.27.15.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.27.15.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ἀλλὰ κἂν ἀποδῶται, μέχρι τοῦ Ἰωβηλαίου καθέξει ὁ πριάμενος, καὶ μετὰ τοῦτον ἔσται Θεοῦ.",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.27.16",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.27.16",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Στίχ. ις΄. Ἐὰν δὲ ἀπὸ τοῦ ἀγροῦ.",
    "chunk_index": 24,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1#tlg2042.tlg068.27.16.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2042/tlg068/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2042.tlg068.27.16.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Τὸν δὲ ἐξ ἀγορασίας ἀγρὸν ἀγοράσας, οὐκ ἀνακτήσεται τοῦτον ἑαυτῷ· ἀλλὰ πρὸς λόγον ἀποδοὺς τὸν καρπὸν τῷ Θεῷ, ἐν τῷ Ἰωβὴλ ἀποκαταστήσεται τὸν ἀγρὸν τῷ πεπρακότι.",
    "chunk_index": 25,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
